engineered to the filibuster

00:38:47.010 --> 00:38:49.340
for voting rights legislation
that wouldn't apply,

00:38:49.340 --> 00:38:52.040
to things like the public option.

00:38:52.040 --> 00:38:53.160
Which by the way,

00:38:53.160 --> 00:38:55.320
