So, what was I gonna say?

00:39:10.580 --> 00:39:14.720
Oh, so, one last sort of
point on filibuster reform,

00:39:14.720 --> 00:39:17.320
which is I think kind of interest,

00:39:17.320 --> 00:39:19.740
to those in the audience,

00:39:19.740 --> 00:39:22.380
because it is so fundamental
to all of the issues

00:39:22.380 --> 00:39:23.580
